// The client's static command ids and toolbar image ids, one per line.
//
// Not a header: common_resources.h includes this list several times, defining
// CLIENT_COMMAND_ID / CLIENT_IMAGE_ID differently each time, so the constants
// and the compile-time uniqueness check are generated from the same lines and
// cannot drift apart. Add an id here and nowhere else.
//
// CLIENT_COMMAND_ID values must be unique among themselves -- window ids,
// action ids and shell commands are dispatched through one namespace (see
// MainWindowCommandRouter) -- and common_resources.h fails to compile when two
// share a value. CLIENT_IMAGE_ID values name icons in a separate table
// (ui/qt/client_utils_qt.cpp) and may repeat a command id's number.

